       URR region is described in: "From average parameters to    3925 1451   37
       statistical resolved resonances", D. Rochman et al.,       3925 1451   38
       Annals of Nucl. Ene. 51 (2013) 60.                         3925 1451   39
       The s-wave average level spacing is 3699 eV and            3925 1451   40
       the s-wave neutron strength is 4.653e-05 1e-4.             3925 1451   41
